  2 August 2024, no version stated).

Status: The AI RMF is a voluntary framework of the US agency National
Institute of Standards and Technology (NIST). It is neither law nor a
standard; NIST does not certify. A revision has been announced; on
21 October 2026 no draft was available. AI RMF 1.0 remains authoritative.

